"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#2c2c2e\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#2c2c2e;margin:0 auto;text-align:left\"><tr><td class=\"hd-body\" bgcolor=\"#2c2c2e\" style=\"padding:6px 16px 20px;background-color:#2c2c2e;color:#d1d1d6;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-wrap:break-word\">\n<p class=\"hd-inkrule hd-ink\" style=\"margin:0;padding:6px 0 5px;border-top:3px double #f2f2f7;border-bottom:1px solid #f2f2f7;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f2f2f7\">Spin-free news · Ranked by impact</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0;font-size:0\"><table role=\"presentation\" class=\"hd-seal-t\" align=\"center\" width=\"140\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:140px;margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:0;font-size:0;padding:0\"><a href=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/\" style=\"display:block;text-align:center;margin:0 auto;text-decoration:none;border:0\"><img class=\"hd-seal\" src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/seal.png\" alt=\"High Impact News Daily\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;width:140px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none\"></a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span class=\"hd-ink hd-wm-p\" style=\"font-family:'IM Fell English',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#f2f2f7\">HIGH</span> <span class=\"hd-accent hd-wm-s\" style=\"font-family:'Pinyon Script','Snell Roundhand',cursive;font-size:31px;margin:0 3px;color:#e08a6f\">impact</span> <span class=\"hd-ink hd-wm-p\" style=\"font-family:'IM Fell English',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#f2f2f7\">NEWS</span> <span class=\"hd-accent hd-wm-s\" style=\"font-family:'Pinyon Script','Snell Roundhand',cursive;font-size:31px;margin:0 3px;color:#e08a6f\">daily</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-head.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"20\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:260px;max-width:80%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n\n<p class=\"hd-accent\" style=\"margin:18px 0 0;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e08a6f\">Evening edition · Wednesday, November 4</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:4px 0 6px;text-align:center;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:14px;color:#8e8e93\">What happened since this morning. Five minutes. No spin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:20px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">Speaker Mike Johnson will not seek to lead House Republicans in the new Congress, setting up a race between Steve Scalise and Jim Jordan.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">Johnson told staff on a Wednesday morning call and wrote colleagues that the job&#x27;s demands on his family drove the decision; he is expected to stay in the House as a rank-and-file member from Louisiana, AP reported, citing two people familiar with his decision. Majority Leader Steve Scalise and Judiciary Committee Chairman Jim Jordan each announced bids in letters to colleagues. House Republicans plan to elect their leaders Tuesday, Nov. 10, when Democrats will take the majority in January after Tuesday&#x27;s midterms.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 4/5.</b> The next House Republican leader will run the minority&#x27;s response to a Democratic House expected to open investigations of the Trump administration. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/speaker-johnson-house-republicans-elections-b8490666bc9fb634fad8c9222f1483ec\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">AP ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">The Dow Jones industrial average jumped 1,569 points, or 3%, Wednesday, its best day since April 2025, after Democrats won Congress, as oil prices fell.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">The Dow closed at 53,356.12; the S&amp;P 500 rose 1.6% to 7,688.62 and the Nasdaq composite rose 1.4% to 25,736.51. U.S. crude oil fell more than 7% after Vice President JD Vance blamed the Iran war for Republican losses, and Treasury yields fell. Bank and retail stocks led; Nvidia, CoreWeave and Tesla fell amid concern over limits on data centers after Democrats&#x27; wins, including Texas governor-elect Gina Hinojosa&#x27;s pledged moratorium.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 3/5.</b> Stocks, oil and borrowing costs moved sharply on the election result in a single session. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/stock-markets-ai-earnings-oil-4d12764c0b3ce38ffde3077712811182\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">AP ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">The death toll from Russia&#x27;s bombing of an aid site in Komyshuvakha, Ukraine, rose to 40 Wednesday, with more than 30 people possibly still under rubble, Zelenskyy said.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">Rescuers have searched for three days after Monday&#x27;s strikes on a school used to hand out aid and a nearby shelter in the Zaporizhzhia region village. AP called it one of the deadliest strikes in the region in nearly five years of full-scale war; Russia&#x27;s Defense Ministry said it targeted Ukrainian military units. Russian attacks also caused hours of power and water outages across Kyiv and surrounding regions Wednesday, AP reported.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 3/5.</b> It is among the deadliest Russian attacks on civilians in the war. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://en.interfax.com.ua/news/general/1231196.html\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">Interfax-Ukraine; AP ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">Vice President JD Vance said the Iran war cost Republicans the midterms, writing, &quot;The reason we lost is the war.&quot;</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">In a long post Wednesday, Vance said many 2024 Trump voters backed Democrats to end the war, over the cost of living, to put America first and to change the U.S. relationship with Israel, and called a suggestion to seek a diplomatic resolution with Iran &quot;sound.&quot; Asked about it, President Trump said he agreed the war &quot;drove the gasoline up a little bit, short term&quot; but said he would do it again because Iran cannot have a nuclear weapon (Axios, Reuters). Trump also told reporters he is not considering replacing Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth, saying &quot;No, I think he&#x27;s doing a very good job,&quot; after CBS News reported, citing multiple sources, that he had asked advisers whether Hegseth should stay.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 3/5.</b> It is the clearest break yet inside the administration over the Iran war as Trump weighs whether to resume major combat. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/jd-vance-2026-midterms-iran/\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">CBS News ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">Senate races in Mississippi and Alaska remained too close to call Wednesday, with Democrats leading both by fewer than 700 votes.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">In Mississippi, Democrat Scott Colom led Republican Sen. Cindy Hyde-Smith by 65 votes out of about 925,000 with 96% of the expected vote counted; mail ballots postmarked by Election Day can arrive through Nov. 10, the state has no formal recount process, and certification is due Nov. 13 (Mississippi secretary of state&#x27;s office via ABC News). In Alaska, Democrat Mary Peltola led Republican Sen. Dan Sullivan 48.2% to 47.9%, by 626 votes, with 74% counted; if no one reaches 50%, ranked-choice tabulation begins Nov. 18. Democrats have already secured 54 Senate seats. AP said 59 House races where party control is at stake were also uncalled as of 4 p.m. Eastern.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 2/5.</b> The two races decide how large the new Democratic Senate majority will be. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/midterm-election-uncalled-races-b20c577aaffced99155af448bd182fa5\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">AP ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">A gunman killed a woman at Citibank&#x27;s Brandon, Fla., office campus near Tampa Wednesday before a Citibank security guard shot him dead, the sheriff&#x27;s office said.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">The driver crashed a sedan through a fence into an outdoor dining area at about 12:11 p.m., shot a woman eating lunch, then went inside toward the cafeteria, where an armed security officer exchanged fire with him, Hillsborough County Chief Deputy Frank Losat said; the gunman died at Tampa General Hospital. Four other people had non-life-threatening injuries. Sheriff Chad Chronister called it a targeted incident. About 3,200 employees were on the campus; 367 deputies and federal agents responded. Names and a motive were not released.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 2/5.</b> It was a workplace shooting at a major bank campus with thousands of employees inside. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://apnews.com/article/florida-active-threat-tampa-business-complex-citibank-6243ee93c43ff9c56d15268c12643507\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">AP ↗</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:0\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/orn-sep.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:180px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#f2f2f7\">Private employers added 86,000 jobs in October, matching September&#x27;s revised gain, payroll processor ADP said Wednesday.</h3>\n<p class=\"hd-body\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#d1d1d6\">Trade, transportation and utilities added 39,000, education and health services 28,000 and leisure and hospitality 19,000, while professional and business services lost 27,000. Pay for workers who stayed in their jobs rose 3.2% from a year earlier. Separately, the Institute for Supply Management&#x27;s services index slipped to 54.5 in October from 54.9, its 28th straight month of growth. The government&#x27;s October jobs report is due Friday.</p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#8e8e93\"><img src=\"https://hinewsdaily.com/assets/email/impact-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" style=\"width:50px;max-width:100%;height:auto;vertical-align:-3px;border:0\"> <b class=\"hd-ink\" style=\"color:#f2f2f7\">Impact 2/5.</b> It is the last private read on hiring before Friday&#x27;s official jobs report. <a class=\"hd-accent\" href=\"https://mediacenter.adp.com/2026-11-04-ADP-National-Employment-Report-Private-Sector-Employment-Increased-by-86,000-Jobs-in-October\" style=\"color:#e08a6f;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">ADP ↗</a></p>\n<p class=\"hd-muted hd-rule\" style=\"margin:34px 0 0;padding:14px 0 6px;border-top:3px double #48484a;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8e8e93\">Coming up</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"hd-accent hd-rule\" style=\"width:64px;padding:9px 10px 9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e08a6f;white-space:nowrap\">Before the open</td><td class=\"hd-body hd-rule\" style=\"padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#d1d1d6\">Uber reports third-quarter results; call 8:00 a.m. ET.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"hd-accent hd-rule\" style=\"width:64px;padding:9px 10px 9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e08a6f;white-space:nowrap\">After the close</td><td class=\"hd-body hd-rule\" style=\"padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#d1d1d6\">Qualcomm reports fiscal fourth-quarter and full-year results after the close; call 4:45 p.m. ET.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"hd-accent hd-rule\" style=\"width:64px;padding:9px 10px 9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e08a6f;white-space:nowrap\">10:00 a.m. ET</td><td class=\"hd-body hd-rule\" style=\"padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #48484a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#d1d1d6\">October ISM Services PMI, 10:00 a.m. ET.</td></tr></table>\n<p class=\"hd-muted\" style=\"margin:30px 0 0;text-align:center;font-family:'Source Serif 4','Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:15px;color:#8e8e93\">That&#x27;s the day. Put the phone down and enjoy your evening.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" 